---
import Section from "@/components/ui/Section.astro";
---

<Section id="team" containerClass="split">
  <div>
    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      Sadaqah Code was founded and is maintained by the
      <a href="https://flagodna.com">FlagoDNA team</a>, which leads the
      technical development and stewardship of the initiative.
    </p>
    <p>
      Sadaqah Code provides the open-source identity, mission, and
      principles that guide this work. The community is welcome to
      contribute, collaborate, and benefit from the projects.
    </p>
  </div>
  <ol class="steps">
    <li>
      <strong>FlagoDNA</strong> leads technical development and
      maintenance.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Sadaqah Code</strong> carries the mission and guiding
      principles.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>The community</strong> contributes, collaborates, and
      benefits.
    </li>
  </ol>
</Section>
